Comment: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:22.70,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1910,10)\fad(500,500)}夜空を見上げて
Comment: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:36.93,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1910,10)\fad(500,500)}花火に　願いと　笑顔を
