Comment: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:56.90,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1910,60)\fad(500,500)}如今已然
Comment: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:06.45,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1910,60)\fad(500,500)}朝著遠方
